  "body": "Packed with potential and positioned at the end of a cul-de-sac, this traditional weatherboard home presents an exciting opportunity to unlock serious value in the heart of Silverdale.\r\nSet on a generous 1,004sqm (more or less) freehold site and zoned Business - Mixed Use, this is a property where vision meets opportunity. Whether you're looking to remove, renovate, reconfigure, landbank, or explore future development potential, the possibilities are well worth investigating.\r\nOffering four bedrooms and two bathrooms, the existing home provides a true blank canvas for those ready to roll up their sleeves and add value.\r\nConveniently located close to Silverdale Bus Station, Pak'nSave and key transport routes, and zoned for Silverdale School and Orewa College, everyday convenience is within easy reach.\r\nWhether you're a seasoned renovator, investor, developer, or savvy buyer searching for your next project, this is an opportunity well worth exploring.",
